@startuml
title 批流一致性对账的四层边界

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "1. 输入边界\nKafka 每分区 end offset\n或可对应的 source snapshot" as input #E0F2FE
rectangle "2. 时间语义\nevent time、时区、窗口边界\nwatermark 与迟到策略" as time #DBEAFE
rectangle "3. 变更语义\nINSERT / UPDATE / DELETE\nappend / retract / upsert" as change #FEF3C7
rectangle "4. 物化规则\n主键、顺序、故障重放与幂等" as materialize #FDE68A

rectangle "流任务\n处理到指定 offset 并完成 checkpoint" as stream #F8FAFC
rectangle "批任务\n读取同一输入与维表版本" as batch #F8FAFC
rectangle "可复算结果\n按 key 下钻并回放差异事件" as result #DCFCE7

input -down-> time
time -down-> change
change -down-> materialize
materialize -down-> stream
materialize -down-> batch
stream -down-> result
batch -down-> result

note right of input
  墙上时间不是可靠边界；
  必须能枚举、保存和重放
end note

note right of result
  比较 materialized state，
  不比较中间消息条数
end note
@enduml
